  evidence:
  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH
    source: CultureBotHT
    notes: Imported from CultureBotHT. CAS-RN 323194-76-9 present, but no CHEBI entry
      exists (checked OAK CHEBI sqlite + PubChem CID synonyms). Curator can promote
      to a CHEBI primary if/when CHEBI adds the term.
  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH
    source: CHEBI via OLS (stem-substring)
    notes: Parent class identified via stem-substring; matched_via='L-Aspartic acid
      sodium salt monohydrate'
  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH
    source: MIM curation (#342)
    notes: 'mapping_quality NARROW_MATCH -> CLOSE_MATCH, predicate skos:narrowMatch
      -> skos:closeMatch. narrowMatch asserts this record is *narrower in meaning*
      than CHEBI:17053 (''L-aspartic acid'') — a subsumption ChEBI itself denies:
      it files hydrates under CHEBI:35505 ''hydrate'', never under the anhydrous compound,
      which is not an ancestor even transitively. A hydrate is a distinct substance
      containing the anhydrous form, not a specialization of it. closeMatch claims
      similarity without subsumption. The ontology_id and the record''s own identifier
      are unchanged.'
  - evidence_type: MANUAL_CURATION
    source: MIM Step7d scientific review (#901)
    notes: 'Catalogueline1340 CAS323194-76-9/FW173.1 names sodium L-aspartate monohydrate;
      PubChemCID23679051 gives one sodium, one water and Lconfiguration. No exacthydrate
      or nearer sodium-aspartate term found in bounded CHEBI/NCIT label/synonym/CAS
      searches. Retain CAS and broadMatch to L-asparticacidCHEBI17053 with separate
      B1 registry. See the complete identity, mapping, chemistry and synonym assessment
      in reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/authors/science-b/full-assessments.json;
      owner selector data/ingredients/mapped/L-Aspartic_Acid_Sodium_Salt_Monohydrate.yaml.
      Primary source references: https://github.com/CultureBotAI/CultureBotHT; https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/compound/name/323194-76-9/property/MolecularFormula,MolecularWeight,InChI,InChIKey,IUPACName/JSON;
      https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/backend/api/public/compound/17053/. Captures, exact
      input hashes and scope limits: reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/evidence-manifest.json.
      This curation adds no scientific, mapping-release or role approval; changed
      owner bytes withdraw inherited support.'
